%% Order lifecycle: composite states, choice/fork/join pseudo-states, quoted
%% aliases, state descriptions and multi-line notes.
%% want: Awaiting payment
%% want: Cancelled
%% want: fraud check
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Submitted: submit

    state "Awaiting payment" as Awaiting
    Submitted --> Awaiting: reserve stock

    state fraud_check <<choice>>
    Awaiting --> fraud_check: fraud check
    fraud_check --> Paid: score < 40
    fraud_check --> Review: score >= 40
    Review --> Paid: approve
    Review --> Cancelled: reject

    state fork_ship <<fork>>
    state join_ship <<join>>
    Paid --> fork_ship
    fork_ship --> Picking
    fork_ship --> Invoicing
    Picking --> join_ship
    Invoicing --> join_ship
    join_ship --> Shipped

    Shipped --> Delivered: courier scan
    Delivered --> Closed: 30 days
    Delivered --> Returned: customer return
    Returned --> Refunded
    Refunded --> Closed

    Draft --> Cancelled: abandon
    Awaiting --> Cancelled: timeout
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]

    Picking: pick and pack
    Invoicing: generate invoice

    note right of Review
      Manual queue, staffed
      during business hours.
    end note
